1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,789
Writing, task one. Form number 19. You want to rent a garden plot from the town. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:15,538
Why do you want a garden plot?

3
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,874
I want a garden plot because I live in a flat and I like working outside in the fresh air.

4
00:00:31,933 --> 00:00:33,916
What will you grow in the garden?

5
00:00:44,567 --> 00:00:49,397
I will grow tomatoes, cucumbers, potatoes and also flowers in the garden.

6
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:52,469
Who will help you in the garden?

7
00:01:03,133 --> 00:01:07,311
My wife and our son, who is nine years old, will help me in the garden.

8
00:01:08,367 --> 00:01:17,377
Fill in form 19 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
